OL,3,GNEWSAGrants for pioneering farms which
OL,4,Ause lasers and GPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vineyard using lasers to scare away
OL,7,Fbirds and a farm introducing GPS
OL,8,Fcollars for cattle are among 17 Surrey
OL,9,Fbusinesses awarded a share of a
OL,10,F#500,000 funding scheme.
OL,12,FThe funding from Surrey County
OL,13,FCouncil's Farming Innovation
OL,14,FAccelerator is designed to help rural
OL,15,Ffirms modernise their work and grow
OL,16,Ftheir businesses.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
