OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGrants for pioneering farms which
OL,4,Ause lasers and GPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlbury Vineyard, one of the firms to
OL,7,Fbenefit, plans to install an automated
OL,8,Flaser system to stop birds eating
OL,9,Fgrapes. The vineyard estimates the
OL,10,Ftechnology could boost production by
OL,11,Fmore than 1,700 bottles a year.
OL,13,FWintershall Valley Farm near Guildford
OL,14,Fwill introduce GPS-enabled collars for
OL,15,Fcattle, allowing "virtual fencing" to
OL,16,Fcontrol grazing without moving physical
OL,17,Ffences.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
